OL,3,ARussian glide bomb attack on
OL,4,AZaporizhzhia kills at least 15 people
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia has attacked the Ukrainian city
OL,7,Fof Zaporizhzhia with five glide bombs,
OL,8,Fkilling at least 15 people including
OL,9,Fthree children, officials said.
OL,11,FThe glide bombs hit residential
OL,12,Fbuildings in the south-eastern city on
OL,13,FSaturday morning. At least 16 others
OL,14,Fwere injured in the attack, with more
OL,15,Fstill missing and believed to be under
OL,16,Fthe rubble.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
